    "body": "This should say something about how this policy-controlled feature can only be requested by an Isolated Web App. Saying the default allowlist is `[\"self\"]` implies that top-level documents will have it by default, while in reality only IWAs can have it and because of high-watermark permissions they can only have it if it is listed in the manifest. Effectively this means that the default allowlist is `[\"none\"]` but that isn't a value that's understood by the Permissions Policy spec.",
    "created_at": "2023-07-14T22:23:18Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-07-14T22:23:22Z",
    "html_url": "https://github.com/whatwg/usb/pull/238#discussion_r1264215076",
